The monsters that make up Midranda's special troops are powerful. They caused great destruction during the Invasion of Pillai. We suffered irreparable losses.
We cannot let that happen again.

Please, help the Royal Mages stop these monsters.
I had to lower your attack power by 30% so you do not draw too much of the monsters' attention.

Hunt 100 monsters on the Shadow Road, among them the Crios, the Najan or the Ignis.
When you are done, talk to the Royal Mage on the Road to the Wind.
